    Update contributor docs for the cross-platform build
    
    CONTRIBUTING still told people the app was plain WPF on .NET 8, that it
    does not run on Linux or macOS, and pointed at MainWindow.xaml.cs, which
    no longer exists. It also listed replacing Console.Beep as wanted work,
    which is already done.
    
    The pre-PR checklist now covers the test suite and the asset verifier,
    and adds the rule that matters most: changes to the practice/cooldown
    rules belong in Core and need a test, and the enforcement tests are not
    to be weakened to make a change pass.
    
    CHANGELOG gains an Unreleased entry describing the port. The 1.0.0
    section is left alone — it is an accurate record of what shipped.
    
